@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@sessionId = PEGA_AQUI_EL_SESSION_ID

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Listar módulos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/modules

### Obtener módulo 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/modules/1

### Ejercicios del módulo 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/modules/1/exercises

### Crear sesión anónima
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

### Responder módulo 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/attempts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "moduleId": 1,
  "exerciseId": "m1-e1",
  "answer": "M"
}

### Responder módulo 2 incorrectamente
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/attempts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "moduleId": 2,
  "exerciseId": "m2-e1",
  "answer": "d"
}

### Responder módulo 3
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/attempts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "moduleId": 3,
  "exerciseId": "m3-e1",
  "answer": "A"
}

### Responder módulo 4
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/attempts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "moduleId": 4,
  "exerciseId": "m4-e1",
  "answer": ["ME", "SA"]
}

### Ver progreso
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/progress

### Ver resumen para adulto
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/adult-summary

### Eliminar sesión
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}
